What was the Age of Exploration?;In the 1400s-1700s, Europeans explored and colonized much of the world.
Who was Prince Henry the Navigator?;This Portuguese Prince sponsored Europeans to explore and map the world.
Who was Bartholomew Diaz?;Bartholomew Diaz was the first to sail around the southern tip of Africa.
Who was Vasco de Gama?;Vasco de Gama was the first to sail to India and back to Portugal.
Who was Christopher Columbus?;Christopher Columbus was an Italian explorer who discovered America for Spain.
What was the Reconquista?;The Reconquista was a war where Christian Spaniards reconquered their country from the Muslim Moors (c. 700 – 1492).
What is another name for American Indians?;American Indians are also known as Native Americans.
What is Polygamy?;Polygamy is the practice of having more than one wife at the same time.
What is Columbus Day?;Columbus Day is a federal holiday set aside to honor Columbus’ discovery of America.
